{"_ts": 1789868682.632126, "concerns": [{"id": "ordering-b8025b92", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 2, T009a", "text": "Task T009a explicitly states 'Depends on T012', but T012 is not defined anywhere in the task list. T009a (flow magnitude extraction) requires pre-computed flow fields (T009) as input, yet the dependency is listed as T012 (non-existent) instead of T009. This breaks the producer-consumer flow: T009 (producer) must precede T009a (consumer), but the text claims T009a must complete before T009.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-f81ccd1e", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 2, T009", "text": "Task T009 (full optical flow computation) is marked as 'Foundational' and required for US2, yet it depends on T009a. However, T009a (stratification magnitude extraction) logically requires the flow fields computed by T009 to exist first. This creates a circular dependency: T009a needs T009's output, but T009 is blocked by T009a. The plan text notes 'T009a must complete before T009 due to resource contention', but this contradicts the data-flow requirement where T009a cannot run without T009's output.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-7b82f90a", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 3, T013b", "text": "Task T013b (stratify clips) depends on T009a (flow magnitudes) and T012 (undefined). T012 is missing. Furthermore, T013b requires the flow magnitude data produced by T009a, which in turn requires T009. The dependency chain is broken by the missing T012 and the circular T009/T009a logic.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-ee23a203", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 3, T016a", "text": "Task T016a (Baseline metrics) depends on T012 (undefined). The task description mentions 'using the edit mask', which is produced by T013a. T013a depends on T012. The missing T012 breaks the entire US1 implementation chain.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-894a78a9", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 3, T013a", "text": "Task T013a (video processor/masks) depends on T012, which is not defined in the document. This blocks the start of US1 implementation.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-0bcb0b45", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 3, T013b", "text": "Task T013b (stratification) depends on T012 (undefined) and T009a. The missing T012 prevents the stratification logic from being implemented.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-7d030103", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 3, T016a", "text": "Task T016a (Baseline metrics) depends on T012 (undefined). The task requires the edit mask (T013a) and flow magnitude (T009a), but the dependency on the undefined T012 blocks execution.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-e8c93dd4", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 3, T016b", "text": "Task T016b (Flow-Coherence metrics) depends on T012 (undefined). Similar to T016a, this blocks US2 metric calculation.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-3b61bbc3", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 3, T018", "text": "Task T018 (US2 Contract test) is marked [P] but depends on T012 (undefined). Tests cannot be written/verified if the underlying implementation tasks (T013, T016) are blocked by a missing dependency.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-85bd7dd6", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 3, T019", "text": "Task T019 (US2 Integration test) depends on T012 (undefined). This breaks the test-first approach for US2.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-cda4d2ca", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 3, T020", "text": "Task T020 (Flow-Coherence module) depends on T012 (undefined). The core implementation of US2 is blocked.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-5ef8ffd5", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-liveedit-tow/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:Phase 3, T021a", "text": "Task T021a (Invalid flow handling) depends on T012 (undefined). This blocks the edge-case handling implementation.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-8abe4425", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-906-llmxive-follow-up-exte